OL,3,GNEWSATeacher banned after sending naked
OL,4,Aimages to girls
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teacher who sent explicit images of
OL,7,Fhimself to girls as young as 12 will
OL,8,Fnever be allowed to teach again.
OL,10,FRobert Collins, 39, was head of art at
OL,11,FFormby High School in Merseyside when
OL,12,Fhe sent sexual messages to several
OL,13,Fyoung girls over a four-year period.
OL,15,FHe was caught in June 2023 after
OL,16,Fmessaging an undercover police officer
OL,17,Fposing as a 12-year-old girl. Collins
OL,18,Fasked if she wanted to be "in
OL,19,Fdetention" with him, repeatedly
OL,20,Frequested photographs of her body and
OL,21,Fsent her an explicit image of himself.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
